@startuml sequence-send-notification
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Sequence — Send notification (UC8a, included in UC8)

participant "REST API\n(FastAPI)" as API
participant "Notification\nService" as NS
participant "SMTP server" as SMTP
actor Customer

note over API
  The admin has just set the
  reservation to CONFIRMED (UC8)
end note
API -> NS: send_confirmation(reservation, customer)

alt SMTP configured (SMTP_HOST in backend/.env)\n→ EmailNotificationService
  NS -> NS: Compose e-mail\n(reservation no., dates, total price)
  NS -> SMTP: Connect, STARTTLS, log in, send
  alt e-mail sent
    SMTP --> NS: accepted
    SMTP -> Customer: Confirmation e-mail
    NS -> NS: Log "Confirmation e-mail sent"
    NS --> API: true
  else sending failed
    SMTP --> NS: error / no connection
    NS -> NS: Log the error\n(the reservation stays CONFIRMED)
    NS --> API: false
  end
else no SMTP → LoggingNotificationService
  NS -> NS: Log the notification\n(no e-mail is sent)
  NS --> API: true
end

note over Customer
  Sees the reservation as CONFIRMED
  in "My reservations" (UC6)
  (+ the e-mail, if one was sent)
end note
@enduml
